{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 15, :comments ["<b>And I will plant them</b> — And I will plant them upon their soil like a tree that will not move from its place, and similarly: <i>you will bring them and plant them</i>, and similarly <i>I planted you</i>. The book of Amos is complete."], :book :amos, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 9, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Ibn Ezra on Amos -- Daat" "http://www.daat.ac.il/he-il/tanach/parshanut_hamikra/full-text/eben-ezra/amos"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T18:18:43.856987947Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}